  "details": "As far as i read now, nobody ever told a solution for mod client users. Mod client's are mostly .dll replacement or programs that inject them, but how about vrchat cheks the .dll's? If a foreign dll get's found, they will deleted automatically or ban users with modded things instantly. It would be a solution against \"dos\" attacks and avatar stealing. Just comment if there's any other solution u know about.",
